# Files kept in the repo but NOT deployed to Apps Script by `clasp push`.
# Ignore-list semantics: anything matching here is excluded from the push.

# Local test/tooling (runs in Node, never on Apps Script)
tests/**
node_modules/**

# Parked / not deployed (e.g. needs Workspace admin access we don't have)
disabled/**

# Repo meta
**/*.md
**/*.sh
.DS_Store
.clasp.json
